    {
      "id": "-JHw6d5q4jIlOzowGlKYg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6669.309737859202,
      "y": 2227.3720453346996,
      "width": 781.0394287109375,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ab",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 592869749,
      "version": 1065,
      "versionNonce": 1999095670,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786294369601,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*IDEA: This is a rotation lock - the password = how many times every rotation made lands on a '0'.\n- Number AFTER 99 = 0\n- Number BEFORE 0 = 99\n\n- *VARS: MIN = 0; MAX = 99; Start = 50; Curr. = Start; NumZeros = 0\n\n- E.g. rotation = 'L68':\n    - Split L/R from rotation = ['L', '68']\n    - direction = rotation[0]\n    - turns = rotation[1]\n    - IFF direction == 'L', THEN:\n        - IFF (Curr. - turns) < MIN, THEN:\n              Curr. = (MAX+1) - (turns - Curr.)\n          ELSE:\n              Curr. = Curr. - turns\n    - IFF direction == 'R', THEN:\n        - IFF (Curr. + turns) > MAX, THEN:\n              Curr. = MIN + (turns - (MAX+1 - Curr.))\n          ELSE:\n              Curr. = Curr. + turns\n- IFF Curr. == 0, THEN NumZeros++",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*IDEA: This is a rotation lock - the password = how many times every rotation made lands on a '0'.\n- Number AFTER 99 = 0\n- Number BEFORE 0 = 99\n\n- *VARS: MIN = 0; MAX = 99; Start = 50; Curr. = Start; NumZeros = 0\n\n- E.g. rotation = 'L68':\n    - Split L/R from rotation = ['L', '68']\n    - direction = rotation[0]\n    - turns = rotation[1]\n    - IFF direction == 'L', THEN:\n        - IFF (Curr. - turns) < MIN, THEN:\n              Curr. = (MAX+1) - (turns - Curr.)\n          ELSE:\n              Curr. = Curr. - turns\n    - IFF direction == 'R', THEN:\n        - IFF (Curr. + turns) > MAX, THEN:\n              Curr. = MIN + (turns - (MAX+1 - Curr.))\n          ELSE:\n              Curr. = Curr. + turns\n- IFF Curr. == 0, THEN NumZeros++",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
